0..60 Comment "//! This source shows wildcards in value and type positions."
61..64 Comment "//!"
65..144 Comment "//! A wildcard stands for a term that equations force. A hole is for the author"
145..157 Comment "//! to fill."
158..161 Comment "//!"
162..223 Comment "//! The elaborator binds a most general solution. The checker"
224..248 Comment "//! writes the solution."
249..289 Comment "//! The kernel readmits the declaration."
